model n2_at
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.3 (#247, the lead's N2 ruling): a window in a move's `at` makes its law date a hole, and the old rule is kept: every place is the hole beside it, a plain movement's place too (L §4.4, §5.14). The pin oracle counts such a text apart; this vector keeps the hole's words. Written at C2, stored at the third pin."
source s "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place other: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input w: date
input dx: date
move pw: transfers
  on dx
  at w
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt
move px: transfers
  on dx
  leg cash from world to other amount amt
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  w = window(2026-03-02, 2026-03-06) "s"
  dx = 2026-03-04 "s"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[other] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
ask paid: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
ask plain: bal(other, 2026-03-31)
ask plain_pinned: bal(other, 2026-03-31) with w = 2026-03-03
ask amount: pw.cash.amount
